    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the auxiliary power unit aft mount link and attachment, showing the three standards in service as alternates with the shim selection and the bearing seal.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the auxiliary power unit aft mount link and its attachment hardware, covering the aluminium link, the steel link with bushes and the spherical bearing standards.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn looking forward at the aft mount with the heat shield removed. Three standards appear as alternates at items 10 and 20 and they are ordered against the configuration record, not against the aircraft serial, because the conversion has been running for several years. The shims at item 40 are supplied as a selection and only the required thicknesses are consumed. The bearing seal at item 50 appears on the spherical bearing standard only and has no equivalent on the earlier standards."
    },
